WEBVTT

03:31.993 --> 03:33.413
<b>Geez Louise...</b>

03:33.783 --> 03:36.283
<b>Hanging up on your superior...</b>

03:36.583 --> 03:37.913
<b>That really hurts.</b>

03:38.083 --> 03:40.753
<b>Here I thought you left me,
and all you have to say is,</b>

03:40.793 --> 03:42.123
<b>"I was sleeping?!"</b>
